{"id":"ba77cd70a7f1fd67","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-development.md","title":"初始红项集的发展","display":"df-development — 初始红项集的发展","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"definition","label":"56-df-development","aliases":["56-df-development"],"display":"df-development — 初始红项集的发展","depends_on":["[[56-df-labelled-reduction]]","[[56-df-reduction-residual-transport]]"],"source_section":"§4.5 Definition 4.5.2; Theorem 4.5.4","source_printed_pages":"107","source_ocr_blocks":[128],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"read-and-reconstructed-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-development"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-development</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-development — 初始红项集的发展"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"971588c26e0c9fdf\" href=\"?note=971588c26e0c9fdf\" title=\"56-df-labelled-reduction\">56-df-labelled-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fec2299959a8e3bb\" href=\"?note=fec2299959a8e3bb\" title=\"56-df-reduction-residual-transport\">56-df-reduction-residual-transport</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§4.5 Definition 4.5.2; Theorem 4.5.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"107"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>128</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"read-and-reconstructed-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"971588c26e0c9fdf\" href=\"?note=971588c26e0c9fdf\" title=\"56-df-labelled-reduction\">56-df-labelled-reduction</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,\\mathcal E_R,\\mathcal F_R,\\operatorname{FinRed}_R,\\operatorname{InfRed}_R\">\\(T,\\mathcal E_R,\\mathcal F_R,\\operatorname{FinRed}_R,\\operatorname{InfRed}_R\\)</span>、路径前缀与步投影。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 为正交TRS；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Red}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{Red}_R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Res}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{Res}_R\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fec2299959a8e3bb\" href=\"?note=fec2299959a8e3bb\" title=\"56-df-reduction-residual-transport\">56-df-reduction-residual-transport</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho,U\">\\(\\rho,U\\)</span> 为集合参数；只有下列有界构造中的合法路径及其源红项子集才调用部分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Res}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{Res}_R\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>无限发展谓词的局部参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol t\\in T^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\boldsymbol t\\in T^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol v\\in\\mathcal E_R^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\boldsymbol v\\in\\mathcal E_R^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>；有限路径构造中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol u\">\\(\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol u\\)</span> 为独立有界变量。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_R\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\bigl((\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol u),U\\bigr)\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n(\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol u)\\in\\mathcal F_R,\\;\nU\\in\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Red}_R(s_0)),\\;\n\\forall i&lt;|\\boldsymbol u|\\;\nu_i\\in\\operatorname{Res}_R\\bigl((\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol u)|_i,U\\bigr)\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal D_R\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\bigl((\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol u),U\\bigr)\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n(\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol u)\\in\\mathcal F_R,\\;\nU\\in\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Red}_R(s_0)),\\;\n\\forall i&lt;|\\boldsymbol u|\\;\nu_i\\in\\operatorname{Res}_R\\bigl((\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol u)|_i,U\\bigr)\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dev}_R(\\rho,U)\\iff(\\rho,U)\\in\\mathcal D_R.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Dev}_R(\\rho,U)\\iff(\\rho,U)\\in\\mathcal D_R.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I_R\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\boldsymbol t,\\boldsymbol v)\\in T^{\\mathbb N}\\times\\mathcal E_R^{\\mathbb N}\n\\mid\\operatorname{InfRed}_R(\\boldsymbol t,\\boldsymbol v)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal I_R\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\boldsymbol t,\\boldsymbol v)\\in T^{\\mathbb N}\\times\\mathcal E_R^{\\mathbb N}\n\\mid\\operatorname{InfRed}_R(\\boldsymbol t,\\boldsymbol v)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_R^\\omega\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{(\\boldsymbol t,\\boldsymbol v,U)\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n(\\boldsymbol t,\\boldsymbol v)\\in\\mathcal I_R,\\;\nU\\in\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Red}_R(t_0)),\\;\n\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nv_i\\in\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\operatorname{pref}_i(\\boldsymbol t,\\boldsymbol v),U)\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal D_R^\\omega\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{(\\boldsymbol t,\\boldsymbol v,U)\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n(\\boldsymbol t,\\boldsymbol v)\\in\\mathcal I_R,\\;\nU\\in\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Red}_R(t_0)),\\;\n\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nv_i\\in\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\operatorname{pref}_i(\\boldsymbol t,\\boldsymbol v),U)\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{InfDev}_R(\\boldsymbol t,\\boldsymbol v,U)\n\\iff(\\boldsymbol t,\\boldsymbol v,U)\\in\\mathcal D_R^\\omega.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{InfDev}_R(\\boldsymbol t,\\boldsymbol v,U)\n\\iff(\\boldsymbol t,\\boldsymbol v,U)\\in\\mathcal D_R^\\omega.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每一步只允许收缩初始 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 的当前残余；归约中创建但不属于这些残余的新 redex 不允许选用。有限与无限的谓词分别定义，后续 FD 才能准确排除无限发展。先在合法路径及其源红项子集上构造关系，再用成员关系定义谓词；因此不合法的路径/初始集给出假值，不会在合取式中对部分函数暗用短路求值。无限构造先限制到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I_R\">\\(\\mathcal I_R\\)</span>，保证每个有限前缀合法。零步路径总是合法发展；空初始集只有零步发展。正交性由上游残余接口继承，不能把这些谓词直接当作一般重叠TRS的标准残余理论。</p>\n<p>对应原书带线定义：在源项中恰给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 的 redex 头加下划线，只允许带线头规则收缩，匹配中的变量像连同其下划线复制或删除。按每一步单步残余的四类公式归纳，当前带线头恰是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho|_i,U)\">\\(\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho|_i,U)\\)</span>；因此此位置接口与 Definition 4.5.2 的可提升发展等价。这一对应也逐前缀适用于无限序列。标记仅用于本证明，不参与发展谓词的隐含参数。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese (2003), Definition 4.5.2；残余位置编码是本目录对原书 underlining 的显式重建，未作机器形式化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-labelled-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"971588c26e0c9fdf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-labelled-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-reduction-residual-transport","status":"resolved","id":"fec2299959a8e3bb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-reduction-residual-transport]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-labelled-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"971588c26e0c9fdf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-labelled-reduction]] 的 $T,\\mathcal E_R,\\mathcal F_R,\\operatorname{FinRed}_R,\\operatorname{InfRed}_R$、路径前缀与步投影。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-reduction-residual-transport","status":"resolved","id":"fec2299959a8e3bb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R$ 为正交TRS；$\\operatorname{Red}_R$、$\\operatorname{Res}_R$ 见 [[56-df-reduction-residual-transport]]。$\\rho,U$ 为集合参数；只有下列有界构造中的合法路径及其源红项子集才调用部分函数 $\\operatorname{Res}_R$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T,\\mathcal E_R,\\mathcal F_R,\\operatorname{FinRed}_R,\\operatorname{InfRed}_R","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Red}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Res}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho,U","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Res}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\boldsymbol t\\in T^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\boldsymbol v\\in\\mathcal E_R^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D_R\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\bigl((\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol u),U\\bigr)\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n(\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol u)\\in\\mathcal F_R,\\;\nU\\in\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Red}_R(s_0)),\\;\n\\forall i<|\\boldsymbol u|\\;\nu_i\\in\\operatorname{Res}_R\\bigl((\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol u)|_i,U\\bigr)\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Dev}_R(\\rho,U)\\iff(\\rho,U)\\in\\mathcal D_R.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal I_R\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\boldsymbol t,\\boldsymbol v)\\in T^{\\mathbb N}\\times\\mathcal E_R^{\\mathbb N}\n\\mid\\operatorname{InfRed}_R(\\boldsymbol t,\\boldsymbol v)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal D_R^\\omega\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{(\\boldsymbol t,\\boldsymbol v,U)\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n(\\boldsymbol t,\\boldsymbol v)\\in\\mathcal I_R,\\;\nU\\in\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Red}_R(t_0)),\\;\n\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nv_i\\in\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\operatorname{pref}_i(\\boldsymbol t,\\boldsymbol v),U)\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{InfDev}_R(\\boldsymbol t,\\boldsymbol v,U)\n\\iff(\\boldsymbol t,\\boldsymbol v,U)\\in\\mathcal D_R^\\omega.","display":true},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal I_R","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho|_i,U)","display":false}],"bytes":3409,"backlinks":[{"id":"b06f8242a0a4824a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"正交TRS及有限路径接口同 [[56-df-development]]；$\\rho,U$ 为集合参数，$s,t\\in T$。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-97","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-development.md]]"},{"id":"298ee1b282da57bf","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{InfDev}_R$、无限序列类型见 [[56-df-development]]；发展步测度下降见 [[56-lem-development-measure-decrease]]。"}],"outgoing":["971588c26e0c9fdf","fec2299959a8e3bb"]}